<%- include("partials/header") %>

<div
  class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-10 bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg space-y-6"
>
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">About TinyLink</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">
    TinyLink is a modern URL shortening service designed to help you create,
    manage, and track short links easily. Our goal is to make link management
    simple, fast, and reliable for everyone.
  </p>
  <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">Features include:</p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2">
    <li>Create custom short links</li>
    <li>Track clicks and last access time</li>
    <li>Copy links easily with a single click</li>
    <li>Responsive design for mobile and desktop</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-gray-700 text-lg">
    TinyLink is built using Node.js, Express.js, and Tailwind CSS for a clean
    and modern user experience.
  </p>
  <a
    href="/"
    class="inline-block mt-4 bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors duration-200"
  >
    Back to Dashboard
  </a>
</div>

<%- include("partials/footer") %>
